('An Imperial Human selects Seeker of the Lost Pantheon; Mira instead is Human/Battlefield Medic.', ['Resolve Common first.','Resolve the Human slot, Diplomatic Training slot and two background slots against their actual restrictions.','Mira records her already selected Dwarvish without a Medic language.'], 'Common plus four actual Imperial Human/Seeker choices; the other 43 variants add none; all 14/45/20 rows are present.'),
