('A lesson runs 09:00–09:40, interrupted in its third phase. Separately an eligible Tongues loss applies after 90 credited minutes.', ['Credit 09:00–09:15 and 09:15–09:30; the unfinished ten minutes are not course credit.','Keep 40 actual instruction minutes and one invoice rounded upward to 9 cp.','Subtract the real ten-minute Tongues loss from 90 to reach 80; phase boundaries do not evade its trigger.'], '30 credited minutes, 40 actual minutes, 9 cp; independent actual Tongues loss preserved.'),
