('Message addresses a perceived recipient within120ft who does not know its language. Later Speak with Dead addresses lawful remains.', ['Message carries the brief utterance but creates no translation/reply or cover exception.','Corpse casting uses its Action without a question.','Each later unified inquiry/answer spends its Action and one allowance, including an unknown/uncomprehended attempt.','Keep deceased language and memories/beliefs; interpret only with a real timed channel.'], 'No automatic comprehension or omniscience; five exchanges/one minute and original expiration marker remain.'),
