('An Oracle hears Aquan under Tongues I; a nearby Common ally can hear, while another ally is Deafened but willing for Echo Voice.', ['Oracle interprets relevant content for the eligible hearing ally; +2 only on the actually related allowed check.','Do not award the hearing bonus to the Deafened ally through ordinary speech.','A lawful Echo Voice exchange can convey directed intentional mental meaning separately.','Do not charge one RC for each passive message or use it to start a speech-required boon while Silenced.'], 'Receptive competence, interpreted hearing bonus, passive telepathy and paid reroll are separate interfaces.'),
