('A researcher has two Insight for Gnomish and a new authenticated useful public500 correspondence into known Common.', ['09:00–10:00 actual study gains one point:2→3.','10:00–18:00 separate work spends3 on one registered supported200-word passage into Common:3→0.','A second physical copy shares the same evidence key and grants no additional point.','A separate full ledger at6 records a saturated study without banking excess; later spending does not make that evidence fresh.'], 'Nine actual hours, one supported passage, no fluency/course double credit or extra roll; cap6 and per-reader history persist.'),
('A reader owns a zero-language reference and recognizes an encoded script\'s letters, but lacks the actual casting prerequisites.', ['Preserve languages:0 on all three identified zero-language public references.','Require actual readable functional payload and qualified class/rank/school/casting gates before script use.','Do not add a reference-consultation minute to script activation.','Runic letters alone supply neither tool credential nor arm/disarm, trigger or recharge.'], 'Actual Scribing and rune gates; literal understanding is not missing magical function.'),
('At 09:00 an INT6 capable consenting user with actual tools binds an accessible unbound device; in round20 they command a visible configured device within60ft.', ['Finish ten active minutes and record the controller/task without changing existing service/HP history.','Commit the actual Bonus Action on the regular turn and the shared round20 command/offense allowance.','Execute after the whole turn; failed execution does not refund the budget.','Reject a second class/crafted command in round20 or a telepathic ally acting as undocumented hardware.','TD08 separately remains two current Dissonance into one own active eligible device30ft.'], 'Real channel/controller, shared per-owner budget and service histories persist; no ownership hack or reset.'),
('An old save contains only Common/Mycelian; abbreviated Human and Undead arrays omit choices.', ['Preserve original bytes and source field presence/null/empty distinctions.','Mark the actual missing choice for evidenced resolution.','Do not auto-select Mycelic, erase a valid previous choice or charge retroactive study.','Keep the152 submitted payloads and current dependencies unchanged.'], 'Derived candidate records only; no runtime migration performed.'),
